{"id":"alarma","lemma":"alarma","pos":"noun","rank":1631,"glosses":["alarm (a summons to arms)","alarm (a sound intended to give notice of approaching danger)","alarm (a mechanical device for rousing attention)"],"ipa":"/aˈlaɾma/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"alarmas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-alarma.wav","examples":[{"text":"Da la alarma.","en":"Sound the alarm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722119","words":[{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Era una falsa alarma.","en":"It was a false alarm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454064","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"false","l":"falso"},null]},{"text":"Hoy tuvimos dos falsas alarmas.","en":"Today, we had two false alarms.","words":[{"g":"today, tonight"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"false","l":"falso"},null]},{"text":"Olvidé poner la alarma.","en":"I forgot to set the alarm.","words":[{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"to put, to place"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Me quedé dormido porque mi alarma no sonó.","en":"I overslept because my alarm didn't go off.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607922","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be , to end up","l":"quedar"},{"g":"asleep, sleeping"},{"g":"because"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to sound, to ring","l":"sonar"}]}]}